Article 4 (Applicability to Collection of Reduction or Exemption as Penalty from Ships Fueled by Natural Gas)
The amended provisions of the proviso of Article 64 (3) and the subparagraphs of that paragraph shall begin to apply form the first case where acquisition tax is reduced or exempted after January 1, 2020.
Article 5 (Applicability to Reduction or Exemption for Urban Development Projects)
(1) The amended provisions of Article 74 (1) and (3) shall begin to apply from the first urban development project defined in Article 2 (1) 2 of the Urban Development Act or redevelopment project defined in subparagraph 2 (b) of Article 2 of the Act on the Improvement of Urban Areas and Residential Environments, whose implementation plan under Article 17 of the Urban Development Act or whose project implementation plan under Article 50 of the Act on the Improvement of Urban Areas and Residential Environments is authorized, after January 1, 2020.
(2) The amended provisions of Article 74 (4) 1 and 3 and (3) and (5) shall begin to apply from the first residential environment improvement project defined in subparagraph 2 (a) of Article 2 of the Act on the Improvement of Urban Areas and Residential Environments or redevelopment project defined in item (b) of that subparagraph, whose project implementation plan under Article 50 of the Act on the Improvement of Urban Areas and Residential Environments is authorized, after January 1, 2020.
