Acquisition tax on real estate acquired by the Korea Institute of Radiological and Medical Sciences under the amended provisions of Article 37 (1) 7 to use directly for its unique duties, whose first liability to pay property tax on the relevant real estate arises less than five years ago, shall be reduced (excluding cases where such real estate is not used for its unique duties as at the tax base date) by 50/100 from January 1, 2021 for five years from the date the first liability to pay property tax on the relevant real estate arises after the acquisition of the relevant real estate. In such cases, the period for reduction or exemption of property tax shall be the remainder of five years from the date the first liability to pay property tax on the relevant real estate, beginning on January 1, 2021.
Article 10 (General Transitional Measures)
The former provisions shall apply to the local taxes reduced or exempted, or to be imposed, reduced, or exempted pursuant to the former provisions as January 1, 2020.
Article 11 (Transitional Measures concerning Reduction or Exemption for Former Agricultural Corporations)
