(2) Notwithstanding the amended provisions of provisions, with exception of the subparagraphs, of Article 11 (1), registration license tax on the incorporation registration of a corporation falling under the subparagraphs of Article 11 (1) shall be exempted until December 31, 2020 pursuant to paragraph (4) of that Article.
