Article 14 (Transitional Measures concerning Collection of Reduction or Exemption as Penalty on Scientific Research Organizations and Scholarship Organizations)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 45 (3), the former provisions shall apply to collecting the acquisition tax reduced or exempted before January 1, 2020, as a penalty.
Article 15 (Transitional Measures concerning Collection of Reduction or Exemption as Penalty on Libraries)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 52 (2), the former provisions shall apply to collecting the acquisition tax and registration license tax reduced or exempted before January 1, 2020, as a penalty.
Article 16 (Transitional Measures concerning Reduction or Exemption on Real Estate for Logistics Facilities)
