(1) The amended provisions of Article 6 (1) shall begin to apply from the first case where farmland prescribed by Presidential Decree or woodland to create such farmland is acquired pursuant to that paragraph after this Act enters into force.
(2) The amended provisions of Article 6 (4) shall apply even though 60 days have not passed since a person who acquires farmland, woodland to create farmland, and agricultural facilities as at the time of the enforcement of this Act became a returning farmer.
