(3) Where real estate equivalent to liquidation money is acquired before January 1, 2023 and acquisition tax on the relevant real estate is reduced pursuant to the former provisions of Article 74 (5) 3 or acquisition tax is reduced pursuant to paragraph (2), the reduced portion of acquisition tax shall be collected as a penalty pursuant to the proviso, with the exception of the subparagraphs, of Article 74 (5).
